# Build context for the `docs` image (docker-compose: context = submission root).
# Allowlist: only what solution/docs-site/Dockerfile COPYs. Everything else (node_modules, .venv,
# data, models, .claude, .env*) never reaches the Docker daemon.
*
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs
!process-log
!solution/README.md
!solution/docs-site
# Re-exclude generated/local content inside the allowed folders.
solution/docs-site/.venv
solution/docs-site/site
solution/docs-site/.ruff_cache
solution/docs-site/.mypy_cache
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/.private
